# 统一源码行尾符为 LF（Linux 服务器项目，避免 CRLF/LF 混杂导致 git 持续显示脏与覆盖错乱）
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明确文本类型
*.php   text eol=lf
*.html  text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.py    text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.bat   text eol=lf
*.ini   text eol=lf
*.txt   text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf

# 二进制文件，不做行尾转换
*.db        binary
*.sqlite    binary
*.sqlite3   binary
*.pdf       binary
*.docx      binary
*.doc       binary
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.gif       binary
*.ico       binary
*.tar.gz    binary
*.gz        binary
*.zip       binary
*.bundle    binary
